b85376158f63f54abfb046379567a", "message": "feat: initialize Vite configuration and TypeScript build setup\n\n- Added Vite configuration files (vite.config.js and vite.config.ts) with support for CSS injection and TypeScript declaration generation.\n- Configured build settings for library output in ES and CommonJS formats.\n- Set up asset inclusion for various file types (gltf, glb, png, jpg, jpeg, svg).\n- Established project structure with root and public directory paths.\n- Introduced global LESS variables for styling.\n- Created tsconfig.tsbuildinfo for TypeScript build information.", "created_at": "2025-08-07T10:41:47Z", "repo": "lesca-facebook-share", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "a1ec978c4ee3e031452b94cba3e8e7575b304e8d", "message": "chore: Update webpack devServer configuration to open browser automatically", "created_at": "2024-06-04T06:50:35Z", "repo": "lesca-facebook-share", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "3b5914f4475f433ef5b99e6906c784c82239a4bb", "message": "add babel runtime and upgrade", "created_at": "2023-10-24T06:08:50Z", "repo": "lesca-facebook-share", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "e70dc3de48c2e920b2c9e194dfbb1f9b2dda386f", "message": "upgrade to ts", "created_at": "2022-06-30T11:36:31Z", "repo": "lesca-facebook-share", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "9b4b9c82c19a8eac0537b277446458428c92aa45", "message": "Update package.json", "created_at": "2022-04-07T10:01:08Z", "repo": "lesca-facebook-share", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "ad2fd2a7ceaafef73b15f8d4b6b70b92400832d8", "message": "Update package.json", "created_at": "2022-04-07T08:17:50Z", "repo": "lesca-facebook-share", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "88de129bc764683b5862aaef6ce142812c41afa6", "message": "Update rea